  "name": "The Delegation Divide — Agent Delegability Index (ADI)",
  "description": "An open index of AI-agent delegability for 436 ISCO-08 occupations and 190 countries. Scores every ESCO task on three layers (augmentation, partial delegation, full delegation) with four frontier models, validated against 1,500 human-rated tasks, and aggregates to ISCO-08 and to countries via ILOSTAT. Ships a Python package (adi-index) and an MCP server (adi-mcp) so AI agents can query and cite the index.",
